    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a friend, hit the field, and brace yourself for Gameday Mayhem!! \u2013 the local multiplayer brawl that asks: &quot;What if football had no strategy, no rules, and possibly\u2026 a rifle?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a 3-minute duel where two players run, dodge, tackle, and fumble their way to victory. Want to pass the ball? Sure, but don\u2019t expect your AI teammates to help\u2014they\u2019re barely functional. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think Nidhogg meets American football. So, lace up, lock in, and prepare for zero strategy, all chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364980/extras/dcb12014cd25015ed5bb3c051483f771.avif?t=1743754048\" width=616 height=616 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(and Gameday Mayhem may actually be the worst game!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GameDay Mayhem!!\u00a0 is <strong>2-Player-only and local-only</strong>. It supports gamepads but it can also be played with two players on one keyboard. Try the demo to find out if your keyboard supports shared keyboard. To play online with a friend you can use Remote Play Together.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a friend, hit the field, and brace yourself for Gameday Mayhem!! \u2013 the local multiplayer brawl that asks: &quot;What if football had no strategy, no rules, and possibly\u2026 a rifle?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a 3-minute duel where two players run, dodge, tackle, and fumble their way to victory. Want to pass the ball? Sure, but don\u2019t expect your AI teammates to help\u2014they\u2019re barely functional. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think Nidhogg meets American football. So, lace up, lock in, and prepare for zero strategy, all chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364980/extras/dcb12014cd25015ed5bb3c051483f771.avif?t=1743754048\" width=616 height=616 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(and Gameday Mayhem may actually be the worst game!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GameDay Mayhem!!\u00a0 is <strong>2-Player-only and local-only</strong>. It supports gamepads but it can also be played with two players on one keyboard. Try the demo to find out if your keyboard supports shared keyboard. To play online with a friend you can use Remote Play Together.</p>",
